-            "level_ok": level_ok}
+            "level_ok": level_ok,
+            # THE MICROSTEP THESE COUNTS WERE TAKEN AT. Every number in this
+            # datum is a microstep count, and a count only means an angle
+            # once the divisor is known -- 1600 counts is a full turn at 1/8
+            # and half a turn at 1/16. Nothing recorded it, so a datum taken
+            # before a gearshift and verified after would be compared in two
+            # different units and report a step loss that never happened.
+            # The gearshift is off today (config.VEL_GEARSHIFT is False);
+            # this is what has to exist before it is ever switched on.
+            "microstep": _microstep(link)}
 
 
